WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:11.080
The Orion Nebula is a diffuse nebula in the Milky Way situated south of Orion's Belt in the constellation of Orion, and is known as the middle "star" in the "sword" of Orion.

00:11.665 --> 00:18.973
It is one of the brightest nebulae and is visible to the naked eye in the night sky with an apparent magnitude of 4.0.

00:19.513 --> 00:34.788
It is 1,267.0 ± 5.4 light-years (388.5 ± 1.7 pc) away and is the closest region of massive star formation to Earth.

00:35.315 --> 00:38.980
M42 is estimated to be 25 light-years across.

00:39.519 --> 00:42.722
It has a mass of about 2,000 times that of the Sun.
